IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-SMOOTHQUANT-V2.

DATA DIVISION.
01 DIM-D               PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 ALPHA-PCT           PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 OPT-ALPHA-PCT       PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 SNR-DB              PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-SQ2.
    IF DIM-D == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    IF ALPHA-PCT == 0
        MOVE 50 TO ALPHA-PCT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE ALPHA-PCT TO OPT-ALPHA-PCT.
    MOVE 44 TO SNR-DB.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 SNR-DB.
    WEIGHT 30 OPT-ALPHA-PCT.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
